# LAYOUT.md — Where things live

**Read this first** when deciding where a file goes or when onboarding an AI worker.  
Machine-readable buckets: [`config/workspace-layout.yaml`](config/workspace-layout.yaml).

---

## 30-second map

```text
{{ project_name }}/
│
│  ── CONTROL PLANE ─────────────────────────────────────────
├── LAYOUT.md          ← this file
├── README.md
├── AGENTS.md          ← AI bootstrap
├── CLAUDE.md          ← coding + git + policy
├── WORKFLOW.md · BUSINESS.md · GEMINI.md
│
├── config/            layout registry (workspace-layout.yaml)
├── scripts/           automation
├── agents/            role profiles / harness packs
├── docs/              durable knowledge
├── workspace/         scratch only (disposable)
├── tests/             monorepo-level tests
├── jobs/              neo-harness task briefs (if embedded)
│
│  ── PRODUCT SURFACE ───────────────────────────────────────
├── products/          ship code (apps, libraries)
├── services/          shared platform services
├── hosts/             infrastructure as code
│
│  ── NOT PRODUCT ───────────────────────────────────────────
└── lab/               experiments, forks — never customer install
```

| Bucket | Class | Open when you need… |
|--------|-------|---------------------|
| `products/` | **SHIPS** | Product application or library code |
| `services/` | **SHIPS** | Shared services (API, data, graph, …) |
| `hosts/` | ship + personal | Ansible / host provisioning |
| `lab/` | **LAB** | Experiments — never ship as product |
| `docs/` | mixed | Durable notes (architecture, ops, product) |
| `workspace/` | **OPS** | Throwaway session drafts |
| `scripts/` | **OPS** | Automation |

