## Where do I put X?

| I have… | Put it in… | Not in… |
|---------|------------|---------|
| Product app or library | `products/<name>/` | `lab/`, monorepo root |
| Shared service code | `services/<name>/` | `products/` unless it is a SKU |
| Host / OS automation | `hosts/<name>/` | product trees |
| Architecture / ADR | `docs/architecture/` or `docs/decisions/` | `workspace/` |
| Runbook / incident | `docs/ops/` | product README only |
| Research / scouting | `docs/research/` | `lab/` unless code |
| Product / commercial note | `docs/product/` | `lab/` |
| One-off session dump | `workspace/scratchpad/` | `docs/` |
| Experiment or fork | `lab/<name>/` | `products/` until promoted |
| Script that should run again | `scripts/` | chat transcript only |

**Rule:** if it should still matter in 6 months → `docs/` or a product/service/host tree.  
If it is only useful this week → `workspace/scratchpad/`.

**Do not invent new top-level directories** without updating `LAYOUT.md` and
`config/workspace-layout.yaml`.

